  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 12th level, a truenamer has mastered the art of overtone chanting as it pertains to performing his recitations in the First Language. He may now apply up to two inflections to a single recitation and gain the benefits of both. When doing so, add together the Truenaming DC Modifiers of the two inflections and apply the sum to the recitation, then add together the Malleability DC Modifiers of the two inflections, add a further +2 to the summed the Malleability DC Modifier, and apply the sum to the recitation.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/truenamer#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
